# PR #25 — Archived original asset PNGs (5-9 MB each, only kept in git
# for posterity; not used at runtime — Next/Image uses cover.jpg/wax-seal.png/
# watermark.png). 100+ MB of them were ballooning Docker build context and
# triggering OOM in Coolify builder stage.
public/**/_orig-*.png
public/**/_orig-*.jpg
public/**/_orig-*.jpeg

# Scripts run only locally, never inside container
scripts
